| 1027–3826 | per-tile maintenance (is_plant, is_animal, raw fields) | `tile_kind`, `tiles_int` (exact, with sentinels), `tiles_float` |
| 3827–5272 | actors: present, x, y ×482 | `actor_mask`, `actors_float` 0–1, `actor_cell` |
