    39	## Observation: `KaggricultureObsBatch` (schema version 3)
    40	
    41	`T = 200` tiles (own farm cells 0–99, then rival cells 0–99). `A = 482` actor slots (own 0–240, then rival 0–240). `S = 8` shop slots. Float tensors are `float32` unless marked otherwise.
