     1	//! Native conditional grammar for Myolie's canonical actor241 programs.
     2	//!
     3	//! This module computes the masks, finite-state transitions and canonical action
     4	//! decoding. Neural heads, floating-point sampling and RNG remain in the caller.
     5	//! States discard token values once they no longer affect any future mask; plan
