     2	
     3	This document describes the currently available RL observation and action specs.
     4	The Python config API uses pydantic discriminator fields so future specs can add
     5	different options without changing the outer `VectorizedEnv` constructor shape.
     6	`EnvConfig.n_envs` defaults to `2` and must be even so built-in checkpoint
     7	evaluation can split evaluation games across 2-player and 4-player batches.
     8	All tensor shapes in this document are local to one `VectorizedEnv` instance.
